Package: omaxian-voxtype
Architecture: all
Depends: voxtype (>= 1.1.1), xclip, libnotify-bin, procps, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Omaxian integration for VoxType voice dictation (X11/i3, sysvinit)
 Makes the unmodified upstream VoxType package usable on Omaxian OS (Devuan,
 sysvinit, X11/i3):
  * /usr/bin/voxtype picks the AVX-512, AVX2 or baseline CPU build (the
    upstream wrapper runs the AVX2 build on CPUs without AVX2); the upstream
    wrapper is diverted to /usr/bin/voxtype.upstream;
  * omaxian-voxtype-toggle starts the per-user daemon without systemd and
    toggles recording; text goes to the X11 clipboard via xclip;
  * an i3 keybinding (Super+Ctrl+V), seeded once per user.
 The user is NOT added to the "input" group (the evdev hotkey stays off).
